:884,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/Conchyliologie_min%C3%A9ralogique_de_la_Grande_Bretagne_%28IA_conchyliologiemi21845sowe%29.pdf?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Conchyliologie_min%C3%A9ralogique_de_la_Grande_Bretagne_(IA_conchyliologiemi21845sowe).pdf","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=91682150","extmetadata":{"Artist":{"value":"<div class=\"fn value\">\n<dl><dd>Sowerby, James, 1757-1822</dd>\n<dd>Desor, \u00c9. (\u00c9douard), 1811-1882, translator</dd>\n<dd>Agassiz, Louis, 1807-1873, writer of introduction</dd>\n<dd>Nicolet, Hercule, lithographer</dd>\n<dd>Sonrel, Antoine, illustrator</dd>\n<dd>Gaudry, Albert, 1827-1908, former owner. DSI</dd>\n<dd>Jent &amp; Gassmann, publisher</dd></dl></div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<dl><dd>Translation of: The mineral conchology of Great Britain</dd>\n<dd>Issued in 20 parts between 1837 and 1845</dd>\n<dd>\"Imprimerie de J. Gassmann, fils, a Soleure\" --Verso of the half-title</dd>\n<dd>Some plates are signed: Lith. de Nicolet a Neuchatel; Sonrel in lap</dd>\n<dd>Volume 1 (texte) has [4], viii, [1], 10-682 pages; volume 2 (planches) has [4] pages, 403 leaves of plates (some folded)</dd>\n<dd>Plates 13-16 are misnumbered as 9-12; plate 52 is misnumbered as 32; plate 203 is misnumbered as 202; and plates 379-403 are misnumbered as 371-395. Plates 176 &amp; 177 are printed together on the same leaf; so are plates 198 &amp; 199. In addition to plate 99, there are also three plates numbered 99a, 99b, and 99c. There is no plate numbered 288, which was omitted from the foliation sequence without loss of content</dd>\n<dd>Includes index</dd>\n<dd>volume 1. Texte. -- volume 2. Planches</dd>\n<dd>Nissen, C. Zoologische Buchillustration</dd>\n<dd>Catalogue of the books, manuscripts, maps and drawings in the British Museum (Natural History)</dd>\n<dd>Antiquariaat Junk;</dd>\n<dd>SCNHRB copy (volume 1, 39088018372755; volume 2, 39088018372797) has stamp on title page: Biblioth\u00e8que Albert Gaudry Palaeontologie Museum</dd>\n<dd>SCNHRB copy has bookplate: Smithsonian Institution Libraries. Purchased with funds from Dr. Alan R. Kabat and the Cullman Endowment</dd>\n<dd>SCNHRB copy has contemporary green and black mottled paper boards with gilt-tooled black leather spines; raised bands; and marbled endpapers</dd></dl>\n<br>Subjects: Mollusks, Fossil; Paleontology</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<dl><dd><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://archive.org/details/conchyliologiemi21845sowe\">https://archive.org/details/conchyliologiemi21845sowe</a></dd>\n<dd><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://archive.org/download/conchyliologiemi21845sowe/conchyliologiemi21845sowe.pdf\">https://archive.org/download/conchyliologiemi21845sowe/conchyliologiemi21845sowe.pdf</a></dd></dl>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}},"mime":"application/pdf"}]},"91461968":{"pageid":91461968,"ns":6,"title":"File:Des Herrn Geoffroy D. und Prof. der Arzney Wissenschaft in Paris Kurze Abhandlung von den Conchylien, welche um Paris sowohl auf dem Lande, als in s\u00fcssen Wassern gefunden werden (IA desherrngeoffroy00geoff).pdf","index":21,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":13636710,"width":668,"height":1133,"pagecount":192,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d6/Des_Herrn_Geoffroy_D._und_Prof._der_Arzney_Wissenschaft_in_Paris_Kurze_Abhandlung_von_den_Conchylien%2C_welche_um_Paris_sowohl_auf_dem_Lande%2C_als_in_s%C3%BCssen_Wassern_gefunden_werden_%28IA_desherrngeoffroy00geoff%29.pdf?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Des_Herrn_Geoffroy_D._und_Prof._der_Arzney_Wissenschaft_in_Paris_Kurze_Abhandlung_von_den_Conchylien,_welche_um_Paris_sowohl_auf_dem_Lande,_als_in_s%C3%BCssen_Wassern_gefunden_werden_(IA_desherrngeoffroy00geoff).pdf","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=91461968","extmetadata":{"Artist":{"value":"<div class=\"fn value\">\n<dl><dd>Geoffroy, M. (Etienne-Louis), 1725?-1810</dd>\n<dd>Martini, Friedrich Heinrich Wilhelm, 1729-1778</dd>\n<dd>Happe, Andreas Friedrich, ill</dd>\n<dd>Berry, S. Stillman (Samuel Stillman), 1887-1984, former owner. DSI</dd>\n<dd>Roper, Clyde F. E., 1937-, donor. DSI</dd>\n<dd>Richmond, Charles Wallace, 1868-1932, former owner. DSI</dd></dl></div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<dl><dd>Translation of his Trait\u00e9 sommaire des coquilles, tant fluviatiles que terrestres, qui se trouvent aux environs de Paris. Paris, 1767</dd>\n<dd>Added engraved t.p. signed: A.F. Happe, invent</dd>\n<dd>Woodcut head- and tail-pieces, initials</dd>\n<dd>Signatures: pi\u00b2AB-CDE-LM(A2,3,4 signed A3,4,5)</dd>\n<dd>Includes bibliographical references and index</dd>\n<dd>SCNHRB has two copies</dd>\n<dd>SCNHRB c. 1 (39088013486295) has bookplate: Smithsonian Institution Libraries. Bequest of S. Stillman Berry</dd>\n<dd>SCNHRB c. 1 bound in gray paste-paper boards, paper spine label with ms. title; housed in an archival cardboard box</dd>\n<dd>SCNHRB c. 1 bound with: D. Jacob Christian Sch\u00e4ffers Nachtrag zu den ersten und fernern Versuchen mit Schnecken. Regensburg\u00a0: Gedruckt bey Johann Christoph Keyser, 1770. Bound together subsequent to publication</dd>\n<dd>SCNHRB c. 2 (39088013486337) inscribed on verso of t.p.: Chas. W. Richmond. Stamped on 3rd leaf: Smithsonian Institution National Museum Richmond Collection [ms. acc. no.] 183894</dd>\n<dd>SCNHRB c. 2 has [4] p., \"Nachricht,\" inserted at end</dd