839-1840 (IA voyageaupolesud3dumo).pdf","index":22,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":10302436,"width":2091,"height":2972,"pagecount":106,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bf/Voyage_au_pole_sud_et_dans_l%27Oc%C3%A9anie_sur_les_corvettes_l%27Astrolabe_et_la_Z%C3%A9l%C3%A9e_-_pendant_les_ann%C3%A9es_1837-1838-1839-1840_%28IA_voyageaupolesud3dumo%29.pdf?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Voyage_au_pole_sud_et_dans_l%27Oc%C3%A9anie_sur_les_corvettes_l%27Astrolabe_et_la_Z%C3%A9l%C3%A9e_-_pendant_les_ann%C3%A9es_1837-1838-1839-1840_(IA_voyageaupolesud3dumo).pdf","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=91869582","extmetadata":{"Artist":{"value":"<div class=\"fn value\">\n<dl><dd>Dumont d'Urville, Jules-S\u00e9bastien-C\u00e9sar, 1790-1842</dd>\n<dd>Jacquinot, Charles Hector, 1796-1879</dd>\n<dd>Dall, William Healey, 1845-1927, former owner. DSI</dd>\n<dd>Library of Congress, former owner. DSI</dd>\n<dd>U.S. Coast and Geodetic Survey. Library and Archives, former owner. DSI</dd>\n<dd>Astrolabe expedition, 1837-1840</dd></dl></div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<dl><dd>statement of responsibility: sous le commandement de M. Dumont d'Urville, capitaine de vaisseau, publi\u00e9 par ordre du gouvernement et sous la direction sup\u00e9rieure de M. Jacquinot, capitaine de vaisseau, commandant de la Z\u00e9l\u00e9e\u00a0; Zoologie</dd>\n<dd>\"Paris. --Imprimerie de J. Claye et Ce. ...\" --p. [6]</dd>\n<dd>Some leaves of plates have embossed stamp: Gide, Editeur, Paris</dd>\n<dd>action: extracted picklist 20081216 BHLEX</dd>\n<dd>(for SCNHRB c. 2 only): v. 1. Mammif\u00e8res, oiseaux -- v. 2. oiseaux (cont.), sauriens, ophidiens, batraciens, poissons, insectes coleopt\u00e8res -- v. 3. insectes coleopt\u00e8res (cont.), lepidopt\u00e8res, insectes orthopt\u00e8res, crustac\u00e9s, mollusques, zoophytes</dd>\n<dd>extracted picklist</dd>\n<dd>SCNHRB copy 1 (no. 39088006781488) is bound in 1 v</dd>\n<dd>Copy 1 has pencilled note on t.p.: Note this is not original edition of title page, but 1853 reissue. [Signed with illegible initials]</dd>\n<dd>Plates 23-24 (mollusques) of c. 1 have pencilled note: According to stamps in French National Library, published between Dec. 1851-Dec. 1852. P. Bouchet (1979, in list)</dd>\n<dd>Copy 1 has stamp on t.p.: Library of Congress, city of Washington</dd>\n<dd>Copy 1 has bookplate: Ex libris William Healey Dall, Division of Mollusks sectional library [also stamped on front free endpaper]</dd>\n<dd>Copy 1 bound in burgundy buckram</dd>\n<dd>SCNHRB copy 2 has been rebound in 3 v. (no. 39088008017451, 39088007998008, and 39088007998073), and every page and plate has been encapsulated</dd>\n<dd>Copy 2 has stamps on t.p.: U.S. C. &amp; G. Library and Archives, no. 2926, shelf 858, case B.R. 508; U.S. Coast Survey Library</dd>\n<dd>Copy 2 bound in modern, linen-covered boards</dd></dl>\n<br>Subjects: Zoology; Scientific expeditions; Description and travel; Z\u00e9l\u00e9e (Frigate)</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<dl><dd><a href=\"//archive.org/details/voyageaupolesud3dumo\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"iarchive:voyageaupolesud3dumo\"><bdi class=\"description en\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Internet Archive identifier:</bdi> voyageaupolesud3dumo</a></dd>\n<dd><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://archive.org/download/voyageaupolesud3dumo/voyageaupolesud3dumo.pdf\">https://archive.org/download/voyageaupolesud3dumo/voyageaupolesud3dumo.pdf</a></dd></dl>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}},"mime":"application/pdf"}]},"199732151":{"pageid":199732151,"ns":6,"title":"File:\u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be\u0